This file is best read without line wrapping.


This is the dataset for the published ChIMES model with DOI:
	+ https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0157238

The published parameters are availble in these locations:

	+ /p/lustre1/rlindsey/ChIMES_Nitrogen-210909/generate_models-DFTBref/al_2+3b-allPBE-AL-211227-no12k/ALC-8/GEN-FF_ALC-5-rc_8-5-4-O_25-10-4/ params.txt.reduced
	+ https://github.com/LindseyLab-umich/Unpublished_ChIMES_Models/blob/main/ChIMES-N/N.params.txt.reduced
	+ Will be uploaded to chimes_calculator/serial_interface/force_fields

