The .xyzf files follow the standard .xyz file format, with coordinate positions in Ang. There are additional
columns at the end of each coordinate line giving the corresponding x, y, and z-force components in H/B. The 
comment line gives the simulation cell a, b, and c lattice vectors in Ang, followed by the stress tensor in 
GPa as sxx syy szz sxy sxz syz. The final line item is the overall system energy in kcal/mol
